          "summary": "Add an SFJ performance warranty for the SFJ Services (workmanlike standard, SOPs/Protocol/Applicable Law including GCP and ICH) with a re-performance remedy at SFJ's cost.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] SFJ conducts the Clinical Trials in the SFJ Territory and provides CRO oversight, but Article 13 gives us no performance warranty for that work and Section 13.6.2 disclaims everything outside Article 13. We have added, inside Section 13.5 so that it sits within the 13.6.2 carve-out, a warranty that the SFJ Services will be performed in a professional and workmanlike manner and in accordance with the SFJ SOPs, the Protocol and Applicable Law (including GCP/ICH), with re-performance at SFJ's cost as our remedy.",
