              "paragraphId": "p0739",
              "oldText": "13.5 SFJ Representation, Warranty and Covenant. SFJ hereby represents, warrants and covenants that it will have, as and when needed, sufficient funds to satisfy its obligations hereunder.",
              "newText": "13.5 SFJ Representations, Warranties and Covenants. SFJ hereby represents, warrants and covenants that (a) it will have, as and when needed, sufficient funds to satisfy its obligations hereunder; and (b) the SFJ Services and all other Clinical Trials activities conducted by SFJ or its Permitted Third Parties will be performed in a professional and workmanlike manner consistent with industry standards and in accordance with the SFJ SOPs, the applicable Protocol and all Applicable Laws (including GCP and ICH guidelines). In the event of any breach of the warranty in clause (b), SFJ will, promptly following notice from PB, re-perform the affected activities in conformance with such warranty at SFJ's sole cost and expense, and such costs shall not be included in Development Costs; the foregoing remedy is in addition to, and not in lieu of, any other remedies available to PB under this Agreement."
